'''Adherence to Virtue''' is the sixth and final stage in [[Garden of Wilted Thoughts]]. The first [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]], [[Sage of Mind Soractes]] is introduced here and can be unlocked as a [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Cat Unit]] at a 30% chance when beating the stage (guaranteed if a Treasure Radar is used). This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

